* Topology: unity-gain Sallen-Key 2nd-order low-pass (equal-R form not used;
* the capacitor ratio carries Q so the passband stays at unity gain)
* Nodes: in -> out. na is the R1/R2 junction, nb the op-amp + input.
{{ models }}
R1 in na  {{ components.R1.value | spice }}
R2 na nb  {{ components.R2.value | spice }}
C2 nb 0   {{ components.C2.value | spice }}
C1 na out {{ components.C1.value | spice }}
